---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '@/components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '@/components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="免费苹果ID共享 - 机场指南"
  description="美区苹果ID共享账号，用于下载特定应用。"
>
  <Header />

  <main class="py-12 lg:py-16">
    <div class="container-custom max-w-4xl">
      <!-- 面包屑 -->
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600 mb-8">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-primary-600">首页</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-slate-900">免费苹果ID共享</span>
      </nav>

      <!-- 页面标题 -->
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">免费苹果ID共享</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600">美区Apple ID使用指南和注意事项</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 重要警告 -->
      <div class="card p-6 mb-8 bg-red-50 border-2 border-red-300">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-red-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path>
          </svg>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-3">⚠️ 严重警告</h3>
            <div class="text-sm text-red-900 space-y-2 font-medium">
              <p>❌ <strong>绝对不要在iCloud设置中登录共享账号</strong></p>
              <p>❌ <strong>只能在App Store中登录下载，下载完成后立即退出</strong></p>
              <p>❌ <strong>不要开启双重认证、不要修改任何账号信息</strong></p>
              <p>❌ <strong>共享账号可能随时失效，不保证可用性</strong></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 为什么需要美区ID -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">为什么需要美区Apple ID</h2>
        <div class="card p-8">
          <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              许多优秀的应用（如Shadowrocket、Quantumult X等）仅在美区App Store上架，中国区无法下载。使用美区Apple ID可以下载这些应用。
            </p>
            <div class="bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg my-4">
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">常见需要美区ID的应用：</h4>
              <ul class="text-sm text-slate-600 space-y-1">
                <li>• Shadowrocket（小火箭）</li>
                <li>• Quantumult X</li>
                <li>• Surge</li>
                <li>• Loon</li>
                <li>• Stash</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 正确使用方法 -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">正确使用方法</h2>
        <div class="card p-8">
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-primary-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <span class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-600">1</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">打开App Store</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">在iPhone或iPad上打开App Store应用。</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-primary-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <span class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-600">2</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">退出当前账号</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">点击右上角头像 → 滑到底部 → 退出登录。</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-primary-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <span class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-600">3</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">登录共享账号</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-2">使用下方提供的账号密码登录（仅在App Store登录）。</p>
                <div class="bg-amber-50 p-3 rounded text-xs text-amber-900 border border-amber-200">
                  <strong>警告：</strong>如果弹出iCloud提示，点击"不合并"或"取消"。
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-primary-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <span class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-600">4</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">搜索并下载应用</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">在App Store搜索你需要的应用并下载安装。</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-primary-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <span class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-600">5</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">下载完成后立即退出</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-2">下载完成后，返回App Store退出共享账号，重新登录自己的账号。</p>
                <div class="bg-green-50 p-3 rounded text-xs text-green-900 border border-green-200">
                  <strong>提示：</strong>已下载的应用可以正常使用，不受账号切换影响。
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 共享账号区域 -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">共享账号（仅供示例）</h2>
        <div class="card p-8 bg-slate-50">
          <div class="text-center mb-6">
            <div class="inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium mb-4">
              ⚠️ 以下为示例账号，实际使用请自行查找可用账号
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">
              <div class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-2">美区账号 #1（示例）</div>
              <div class="font-mono text-slate-900 mb-2">
                <strong>账号：</strong>example@icloud.com
              </div>
              <div class="font-mono text-slate-900">
                <strong>密码：</strong>ExamplePass123
              </div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-3">
                状态：示例数据，请勿使用
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="text-center text-sm text-slate-600">
              <p>实际账号请从可信渠道获取，本站不提供真实账号。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 风险提示 -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">使用共享账号的风险</h2>
        <div class="card p-8 border-2 border-amber-200">
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path>
              </svg>
              <span><strong>账号锁定风险：</strong>多人使用可能触发Apple安全机制，导致账号被锁定</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path>
              </svg>
              <span><strong>数据泄露风险：</strong>如果在iCloud中误登录，个人数据可能被他人访问</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path>
              </svg>
              <span><strong>应用无法更新：</strong>切换回自己账号后，通过共享账号下载的应用可能无法更新</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path>
              </svg>
              <span><strong>设备关联风险：</strong>可能被其他用户查看到您的设备信息</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 更好的解决方案 -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">更好的解决方案</h2>
        <div class="card p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-50 to-white">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">注册自己的美区Apple ID</h3>
          <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              虽然使用共享账号很方便，但我们<strong>强烈建议注册一个属于自己的美区Apple ID</strong>：
            </p>

            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 my-4">
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">优势：</h4>
              <ul class="text-sm text-slate-600 space-y-2">
                <li>✓ 完全属于自己，没有安全风险</li>
                <li>✓ 可以正常购买付费应用</li>
                <li>✓ 应用可以自动更新</li>
                <li>✓ 可以使用iCloud等全部功能</li>
                <li>✓ 不受他人影响，稳定可靠</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg my-4">
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">注册步骤：</h4>
              <ol class="text-sm text-slate-600 space-y-2">
                <li>1. 访问Apple ID官网注册新账号</li>
                <li>2. 地区选择"美国"</li>
                <li>3. 不需要绑定付款方式（选择None）</li>
                <li>4. 地址可以使用美国地址生成器</li>
                <li>5. 完成邮箱验证即可使用</li>
              </ol>
            </div>

            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-4">
              注册自己的美区ID只需要10分钟，但可以长期稳定使用，是更明智的选择。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- FAQ -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">常见问题</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <details class="card group">
            <summary class="px-6 py-4 cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">不小心在iCloud中登录了怎么办？</span>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              立即退出！前往"设置" → 顶部Apple ID → 拉到底部退出登录。选择"不保留"或"从我的iPhone删除"，然后重新登录自己的账号。
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="card group">
            <summary class="px-6 py-4 cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">共享账号为什么不能用了？</span>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              共享账号可能因为多人使用、密码被修改、被Apple锁定等原因失效。这是共享账号的常见问题，建议注册自己的美区ID。
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="card group">
            <summary class="px-6 py-4 cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">下载的应用安全吗？</span>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              从App Store下载的应用本身是安全的，经过Apple审核。但要确保只在App Store登录，不要在iCloud登录共享账号。
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="card group">
            <summary class="px-6 py-4 cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">如何更新通过共享账号下载的应用？</span>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              需要重新登录当初下载时使用的共享账号才能更新。这也是为什么建议注册自己的美区ID的原因之一。
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
